  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s economic participation and rights in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With professional help, all group businesses of existing WHAE local units will be revised and new feasible business ideas for grassroots women will be developed. Furthermore, in order to succeed with the empowerment of grassroots women, working towards the economic independence of WHAE as an organization will also be a focus area.</narrative>
  </description>
